CALL mh XRemoveEffectFromPlayer Nola_DownedBlock
LOG NOLA LIFE: pawn novo de pe: efeito Nola_DownedBlock retirado por garantia (save feito caido) ok=true
CALL me ForceSetHP 15
CALL build XSetEntityUnkillableByUID 0 true
CALL gm_keep 1
LOG NOLA LIFE: GameManager god off agora poupa o bit 0x2 do jogador (ok=true)
LOG NOLA LIFE: caido protegido Unkillable uid=0 ok=true
CALL me.cm DisableMovement
LOG NOLA LIFE: CAIDO #1 (hp 10.0 <= 15); morre em 30 s ou com o outro jogador a 300 cm por 3 s
CALL rk XApplyEffectOnPlayer Nola_DownedBlock
LOG NOLA LIFE: caido sem armas: efeito Nola_DownedBlock aplicado (atirar, mirar, recarregar, granada, faca, consumiveis, mochila bloqueados) ok=true
CALL me ForceSetHP 30
CALL gm_keep 0
LOG NOLA LIFE: GameManager god off volta a limpar o bit 0x2 do jogador (ok=true)
CALL build XSetEntityUnkillableByUID 0 false
LOG NOLA LIFE: Unkillable uid=0 desligado (de pe) ok=true
CALL me.cm SetMovementMode 1 0
LOG NOLA LIFE: DE PE (reanimado pelo outro jogador) depois de 4.0 s, hp=30
CALL mh XRemoveEffectFromPlayer Nola_DownedBlock
LOG NOLA LIFE: armas liberadas (de pe): efeito Nola_DownedBlock retirado ok=true
OUT ui TOP revdown You are down! A partner staying near you for 3 s revives you. You die in 30 s 0
OUT ui TOP revdown You are down! A partner staying near you for 3 s revives you. You die in 29 s 0
OUT ui TOP revdown You are down! A partner staying near you for 3 s revives you. You die in 28 s 0
OUT ui TOP revdown You are down! A partner staying near you for 3 s revives you. You die in 27 s 0
OUT ui TOPCLEAR revdown
OUT ui TOP revdone Revived by your partner! 4
OUT me hp=30.0 alive=true
